{
  "id": "lineup",
  "title": "A lineup seat that names the other seat's bust wins, and one that names any other loses",
  "binding": "Boots the Parlor lineup world with the computer on seat 2 and sets seat 2's dealt bust to Finn so the script knows it. Seat 1 asks two questions through the act door and the computer answers each on its own turn, so both seats have asked twice; seat 1 then names Finn, the rules judge the name against seat 2's hidden bust, and seat 1 wins. The run is recorded and replays exactly. The discriminating leg names Gus instead: a wrong name loses, so seat 2 wins without naming anyone.",
